Type: Package
Package: pmxlandscape
Title: Corpus, Classifications and Summaries for the PMx Landscape
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R:
    c(
      person("Niclas", "Jonsson", email = "niclas.jonsson@pharmetheus.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
      person("Pharmetheus AB", email = "info@pharmetheus.com", role = "cph")
    )
Description: Tools for the PMx Landscape project, which measures how
    pharmacometric modelling is done in practice, starting with the
    estimation software used. Searches
    cached source text with a shared pattern file, verifies the matches
    against a recorded decision table, and summarises the results per source.
